######
## PARAMETERS REQUIRED FOR THIS SCRIPT
##
##   * contentCatalog   - content catalog id
##   * productCatalog   = product catalog id
##   * siteUid - site id
##   * storeUid - id of the store
##   * channel - site channel; B2B or B2C
#######

# This addon adds no catalogue of its own; the file exists because the core-data import reads the pair
# (catalog.impex, cms-content.impex) and the sibling addon ships both. Everything this addon contributes
# is in cms-content.impex.
